  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "So you’re a detective, are you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F00200079006F0075201900720065002000610020006400650074006500630074006900760065002C002000610072006500200079006F0075003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s correct, sir",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006100742019007300200063006F00720072006500630074002C00200073006900720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m just standing in",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D0020006A0075007300740020007300740061006E00640069006E006700200069006E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well, if Emma’s trusted you with my request,\nthat’s gotta be good enough for me.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 85
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Because we have a situation!!!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThere’s a menace on the loose in Lumiose!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And that menace is none other than...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000740068006100740020006D0065006E0061006300650020006900730020006E006F006E00650020006F00740068006500720020007400680061006E002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A GREAT...BIG...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041002000470052004500410054002E002E002E004200490047002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUNNELBY!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E004E0045004C0042005900210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It was massive—over twice the size of my own\nBunnelby. And its eyes had this real evil glow!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When that thing locked eyes with me, I bolted\noutta there before I had the chance to think.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ve been places and I’ve seen things...but I’ve\nnever been that scared in my life!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 183
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And the worst part? It’s where I saw the thing!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nIt was in a plain old alleyway—not in any of the\nwild zones!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 118
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We can’t let that Bunnelby run wild! I’ll go back\nand stake out the spot where I saw it!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMake sure you <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>turn on guidance<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> for my request\nso you can find the right place as well!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 191
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That giant Bunnelby was somewhere around\nhere...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHaha... Just being here makes my legs want to\nwobble right out from under me.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bunuuu?!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006E007500750075003F00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What is it, bud?! Don’t tell me...it’s here already?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0057006800610074002000690073002000690074002C0020006200750064003F002100200044006F006E20190074002000740065006C006C0020006D0065002E002E002E00690074201900730020006800650072006500200061006C00720065006100640079003F002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUNNAAAAAA!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E004E0041004100410041004100410021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s HUGE!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200048005500470045002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And TERRIFYING!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E0064002000540045005200520049004600590049004E0047002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And AWESOME!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006E006400200041005700450053004F004D004500210021002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This is the Bunnelby! No doubt about it!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540068006900730020006900730020007400680065002000420075006E006E0065006C0062007900210020004E006F00200064006F007500620074002000610062006F00750074002000690074002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "BUNAAARRRGH!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420055004E004100410041005200520052004700480021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I can’t believe you took on that big ol’ Bunnelby!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049002000630061006E20190074002000620065006C006900650076006500200079006F007500200074006F006F006B0020006F006E0020007400680061007400200062006900670020006F006C2019002000420075006E006E0065006C00620079002100100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Watching you in action reminded me of\nsomething, actually...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700610074006300680069006E006700200079006F007500200069006E00200061006300740069006F006E002000720065006D0069006E0064006500640020006D00650020006F0066000A0073006F006D0065007400680069006E0067002C002000610063007400750061006C006C0079002E002E002E00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A long time ago, in some region whose name I\nforgot, people used to live in fear of these giant,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nferocious Pokémon with glowing eyes...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI hear those Pokémon were called <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>alphas<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 195
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I wonder how it is that a Pokémon like that\nshowed up in modern-day Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI couldn’t begin to guess...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "What do you think, bud? Ominous or what?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005700680061007400200064006F00200079006F00750020007400680069006E006B002C0020006200750064003F0020004F006D0069006E006F007500730020006F007200200077006800610074003F00100002011401260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bununuuu...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075006E0075006E007500750075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welp, either way, you really came through. Emma\nclearly has an eye for hiring help!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nWith someone like you looking out for Lumiose,\nwe’ll be fine even if more alphas show up, eh?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĦ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
